WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.749
These are common classification traps The visual
appearance of a value

00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:11.355
can tempt us to classify too quickly ZIP codes and
patient IDs

00:00:11.382 --> 00:00:17.963
are labels Satisfaction is ordered but not
necessarily equally spaced Heart

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:23.279
rate may be stored as an integer while representing
a measurement ER visits is a

00:00:23.305 --> 00:00:29.790
count Celsius temperature is interval rather than
ratio When

00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:34.764
in doubt describe the variable in a sentence and ask
what operations make real-world sense
